.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Flutter
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/
app/.flutter-plugins
app/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
